[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992053280","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2992053280","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2992053280,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yVxwg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T15:29:57Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T15:30:26Z","body":"Your build of the wasm-runtime from godot-mono-builds seems to be lacking this patch:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-mono-builds/blob/master/files/patches/wasm_m2n_trampolines_hook.diff\n\nYou need to run both `patch_mono.py` and `patch_emscripten.py` before building the runtime with godot-mono-builds' scripts.\n\nYou can also download our prebuilt runtimes:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot-mono-builds/releases/tag/release-4912f62","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992053280/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992680932","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2992680932","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2992680932,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yYK_k","user":{"login":"dtsioni","id":7913599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTM1OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7913599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni","html_url":"https://github.com/dtsioni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T20:13:29Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T20:13:29Z","body":"Thank you.\n\nThe project builds with the prebuilt runtime, but the exported build does not actually run on the web. The browser outputs the following error:\n\n```\nERROR: Cannot instance script because the project assembly is not loaded. Script: 'res://Main.cs'. > index.js:369\nat: can_instance (modules/mono/csharp_script.cpp:2888) - Method failed. Returning: 0L > index.js:369\n```\n\nI don't understand, is this supported or not? Getting this to work has been more than an uphill battle, and the documentation here is _severely_ lacking.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992680932/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992727979","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2992727979","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2992727979,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yYWer","user":{"login":"dtsioni","id":7913599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTM1OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7913599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni","html_url":"https://github.com/dtsioni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T20:37:47Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T20:38:10Z","body":"For example, `./patch_mono.py` does not work on the latest `mono/mono` source code commit, only on some undetermined prior commit. Similarly IIRC I had to rewind `emsdk` as well for `./patch_emscripten.py` to work. \n\nThe prebuilt runtime seems to work in regards to those issues however, so thank you for that. But nothing in the documentation gives any clue what to do regarding this project assembly issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2992727979/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993056181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2993056181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2993056181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yZmm1","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-20T22:38:49Z","updated_at":"2025-06-20T22:38:49Z","body":"Yeah it's not very well documented, because it's quite complex, and not relevant anymore for Godot 4 which is the main development focus. The best way to get a working setup is to replicate ours (using `podman` on Fedora):\n- https://github.com/godotengine/build-containers/tree/3.x\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot-build-scripts/tree/3.x\n\nNotably for Godot 3.6, the tested/supported toolchains for Mono are Mono 6.12.0.198 (but latest stable 6.12.0.206 may also work) and Emscripten 1.39.9: https://github.com/godotengine/build-containers/tree/3.x?tab=readme-ov-file#toolchains","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2993056181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994494523","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2994494523","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2994494523,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yfFw7","user":{"login":"dtsioni","id":7913599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTM1OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7913599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni","html_url":"https://github.com/dtsioni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T22:35:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T22:35:20Z","body":"That worked, thank you! That should be in the official documentation, it's a much easier process than getting the build environment set up locally.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994494523/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994497826","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2994497826","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2994497826,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yfGki","user":{"login":"dtsioni","id":7913599,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTM1OTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7913599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni","html_url":"https://github.com/dtsioni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dtsioni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-22T22:42:20Z","updated_at":"2025-06-22T22:42:20Z","body":"Only caveat was that the `$IMAGE_VERSION` in the `godot-build-scripts/build.sh` file was not being set properly when I ran it, and I had to override it with what `podman images` was outputting as the image tag. Not sure if that was my fault or what, but it was easy enough to fix.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994497826/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995020312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/107768#issuecomment-2995020312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107768","id":2995020312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6yhGIY","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-23T05:52:05Z","updated_at":"2025-06-23T05:52:05Z","body":"> Only caveat was that the `$IMAGE_VERSION` in the `godot-build-scripts/build.sh` file was not being set properly when I ran it, and I had to override it with what `podman images` was outputting as the image tag. Not sure if that was my fault or what, but it was easy enough to fix.\n\nYou should copy `config.sh.in` as `config.sh` and fill it with the relevant details, including image name.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2995020312/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]